    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>This game is ideal for YouTubers and Streamers: it allows you to create content, interact with your chatters and let your audience get to know you better! This creates a unique experience, for all parties involved. Players who play this game themselves can also enjoy the single player experience a lot!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056280/extras/9a4dc0b3310181016ab318d9761b29a9.avif?t=1741294095\" width=616 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine that you are in purgatory. Imagine that a demon of lust and debauchery has spoken to you. Imagine that you are not alone there. Imagine that the fates of many people rest on your shoulders. So now don't be afraid... <strong>the Succubus doesn't bite.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056280/extras/b3a58a9cc7f34dfe4314b7c29d23e9c6.avif?t=1741294095\" width=616 height=68 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short and hellness;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extraordinary;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only game of its kind;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit back, relax, and decide your fate;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six Endings;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super affordable for a unique experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>If you don't expect anything, you'll enjoy the game.</i></strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>This game is ideal for YouTubers and Streamers: it allows you to create content, interact with your chatters and let your audience get to know you better! This creates a unique experience, for all parties involved. Players who play this game themselves can also enjoy the single player experience a lot!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056280/extras/9a4dc0b3310181016ab318d9761b29a9.avif?t=1741294095\" width=616 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine that you are in purgatory. Imagine that a demon of lust and debauchery has spoken to you. Imagine that you are not alone there. Imagine that the fates of many people rest on your shoulders. So now don't be afraid... <strong>the Succubus doesn't bite.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056280/extras/b3a58a9cc7f34dfe4314b7c29d23e9c6.avif?t=1741294095\" width=616 height=68 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short and hellness;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extraordinary;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only game of its kind;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit back, relax, and decide your fate;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six Endings;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super affordable for a unique experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>If you don't expect anything, you'll enjoy the game.</i></strong></p>",
